    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>DISCORD</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0da8cfb490b046cf14d7c429a2811c5b.poster.avif?t=1736861053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0da8cfb490b046cf14d7c429a2811c5b.webm?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0da8cfb490b046cf14d7c429a2811c5b.mp4?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THIS IS NOT A GAME OF CLASSIC CHESS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Fog of War</strong> feature hides enemy armies. <strong>Dark Chess</strong> is both about quick decisions, tactical thinking and taking risks or thinking slow and scouting the unknown before taking a step into dark. Reworked and enhanced game rules will bring immense joy to die-hard chess-lovers and casual players alike. Game keeps players thrilled with unexpected moves and unforeseen attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/090109bb36201fe689533a67adf18ae1.avif?t=1736861053\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game-changing feature of Fog of War </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully narrated, story-driven campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and challenge famous kings and queens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All-new visual chess experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable avatars and profiles </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADVENTURE TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.poster.avif?t=1736861053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.webm?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.mp4?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Take a step to walk deeper into the <strong>Dark Chess</strong> single player story campaign to fight Queens and Kings of the past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you dare to challenge the famous <strong>Genghis Khan</strong>, outsmart <strong>King Solomon</strong> or terrify <strong>Ivan the Terrible</strong>? Dare to argue with <strong>Queen Elizabeth</strong> or <strong>Empress Cixi</strong> and keep the head on your shoulders? Be warned my friend, some of them will not play by the rules! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect the unexpected after the first move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/edc3d4d358ac4a2e24d7043606788e58.poster.avif?t=1736861053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/edc3d4d358ac4a2e24d7043606788e58.webm?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/edc3d4d358ac4a2e24d7043606788e58.mp4?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REWARDS &amp; CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever won a difficult chess duel feeling that you deserved a reward and got none? <strong>Dark Chess</strong> is going to reward you for your achievements! For every difficult puzzle you solve, difficult opponent you destroy or clever move you make, you'll be rewarded with an achievement that unlocks visuals improvements. You can customize in game avatar the way you want. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0bb5202fe3d7e58b96a2b5f180d8600e.poster.avif?t=1736861053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0bb5202fe3d7e58b96a2b5f180d8600e.webm?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0bb5202fe3d7e58b96a2b5f180d8600e.mp4?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you are a die-hard chess lover or a board game enthusiast, <strong>Dark Chess</strong> will appeal to anyone who loves the thrill of a chess battle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/cffc2ab1ffa5f0e3898e5aabc7502180.avif?t=1736861053\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE GAME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0da8cfb490b046cf14d7c429a2811c5b.poster.avif?t=1736861053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0da8cfb490b046cf14d7c429a2811c5b.webm?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0da8cfb490b046cf14d7c429a2811c5b.mp4?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">THIS IS NOT A GAME OF CLASSIC CHESS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Fog of War</strong> feature hides enemy armies. <strong>Dark Chess</strong> is both about quick decisions, tactical thinking and taking risks or thinking slow and scouting the unknown before taking a step into dark. Reworked and enhanced game rules will bring immense joy to die-hard chess-lovers and casual players alike. Game keeps players thrilled with unexpected moves and unforeseen attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/090109bb36201fe689533a67adf18ae1.avif?t=1736861053\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game-changing feature of Fog of War </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fully narrated, story-driven campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet and challenge famous kings and queens</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">All-new visual chess experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customizable avatars and profiles </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ADVENTURE TIME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.poster.avif?t=1736861053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.webm?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/4876344926f3c9625ac6032c6743fcb7.mp4?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Take a step to walk deeper into the <strong>Dark Chess</strong> single player story campaign to fight Queens and Kings of the past. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Do you dare to challenge the famous <strong>Genghis Khan</strong>, outsmart <strong>King Solomon</strong> or terrify <strong>Ivan the Terrible</strong>? Dare to argue with <strong>Queen Elizabeth</strong> or <strong>Empress Cixi</strong> and keep the head on your shoulders? Be warned my friend, some of them will not play by the rules! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expect the unexpected after the first move. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/edc3d4d358ac4a2e24d7043606788e58.poster.avif?t=1736861053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/edc3d4d358ac4a2e24d7043606788e58.webm?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/edc3d4d358ac4a2e24d7043606788e58.mp4?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">REWARDS &amp; CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Have you ever won a difficult chess duel feeling that you deserved a reward and got none? <strong>Dark Chess</strong> is going to reward you for your achievements! For every difficult puzzle you solve, difficult opponent you destroy or clever move you make, you'll be rewarded with an achievement that unlocks visuals improvements. You can customize in game avatar the way you want. <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0bb5202fe3d7e58b96a2b5f180d8600e.poster.avif?t=1736861053\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0bb5202fe3d7e58b96a2b5f180d8600e.webm?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/0bb5202fe3d7e58b96a2b5f180d8600e.mp4?t=1736861053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you are a die-hard chess lover or a board game enthusiast, <strong>Dark Chess</strong> will appeal to anyone who loves the thrill of a chess battle.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1151130/extras/cffc2ab1ffa5f0e3898e5aabc7502180.avif?t=1736861053\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "THIS IS NOT CLASSIC CHESS! Dark Chess is a game of chess with fog of war, story-driven campaign with challenges, traps &amp; puzzles. A game-changing feature to conceal enemy army, add more fun and intrigue to a timeless classic. Fight your way through the Campaign or beat your friends and foes in PvP!",
